      raise: 'There is no wagering mechanic in this game, so raising stakes is not a valid action.',
      declare: 'The results of each card flip are immediate and public; no separate declaration phase is required.',
      reveal_hand: 'Stacks remain face down; only the top card is revealed when played onto the central pile.',
      award_pot: 'While players win the center pile, it is not a pot of chips; it is handled by Outcome A/B logic.',
      play_card: 'Must be your turn or your obligation to pay.',
      draw: 'New cards are only acquired by winning the central pile through successful face-card triggers.',
      discard: 'Every card remains in play until collected by a player or the game terminates; no discarding exists.',
